 "device_checks": "Simulator iPhone 17 Pro 9F49DE2E, screen scale 3, so tiles are 768 px; detailZoom is 16 and baseMaxZoom 13. Both sheets were imported with `TACMAP_DEBUG_IMPORT_PDF` (copied into the app's tmp) and shot with the grid on (`TACMAP_DEBUG_GRID=1`) via `TACMAP_DEBUG_CAMERA`. Screenshots, contact_sheet.png and alignment.jsonl are in /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-cbrooker-Code-TacticalMaps/d9f42208-9d3f-40e1-9b8b-49fa6c488260/scratchpad/wp2-shots/ios/.\n\nAlignment comes from audit/grid_alignment.py through a wrapper (scratchpad/wp2_align.py). The wrapper blanks the app chrome and the orange centre reticle, which would otherwise read as printed red. From z16 up, fewer than two printed 1 km lines are on screen, so it takes the scale from the camera zoom. At z18/z20 it measures each line inside a crop away from the line crossing.\n\nWorst printed-grid vs overlay offset (gate is max(1.5 px, 1 m)):\n\n| Shot | sf_iso | rot5_iso |\n|---|---|---|\n| Sheet-fit z12.9 | 0.70 px (medians -0.22 / +0.09 px), 3.8 m at 5.39 m/px \u2014 PASS on the 1.5 px leg | 0.66 px, 3.6 m \u2014 PASS |\n| z14 | 0.27 px (0.68 m) | 0.27 px |\n| z16 | 0.08 px (0.05 m) | 0.08 px |\n| z18 | easting 0.20 px, northing 0.95 px (0.15 m) | 0.20 / 0.95 px |\n| z20 | easting 0.45 px, northing 1.89 px (median 1.5 px = 6 cm) | 0.45 / 1.88 px |\n\nAll PASS.\n\n- **Rotation:** rot5 at z14\u2013z20 matches sf_iso pixel for pixel to within 4 grey levels, so the 5\u00b0 page rotation is removed exactly. The fit shots differ only in the rotated label text.\n- **Bake-backed tiles** (shot after a z0\u201316 bake): z14 0.43 px, z16 0.24 px.\n- **Holes and seams:** zero background-coloured pixels in the map area at z14, z16, z18 and z20 on both sheets. The only column/row spikes are the grid lines themselves.\n- **Off-sheet:** transparent outside the sheet at sheet-fit (dark background, grid continues).\n- **First paint at z17.4, heading 30\u00b0:** dark only in the 0.5 s frame before the source is installed, fully covered from 1.0 s.\n- **Crispness:** edge 10\u201390% transition is about 2 px at z16, about 6 px at z18 and about 26 px at z20. z18/z20 are 4\u00d7 and 16\u00d7 overzoom past detailZoom 16, as the contract requires.\n\nOther device checks:\n- Bake from Layers: the confirm dialog offered z14 (48 tiles, ~1.2 MB), z15 (117, ~2.9 MB) and z16 (363, ~8.9 MB). The z16 run kept going after the sheet was dismissed, with the \"Offline tiles NN% Cancel\" chip. It published offline_tiles/tacmap-bake-*.mbtiles (6.5 MB), left pdf_bake_work empty, kept the PDF active, and Layers then showed \"Offline tiles: zoom 0\u201316 \u00b7 6.5 MB\" with Remove.\n- The guard file holds only UUIDs.\n- Visibility toggle off gives the dark background plus the \"Imported map hidden\" capsule; on again is instant from cache.\n- Importing tacmap_render_blank.pdf through the hook shows the probe failure \"Nothing on this PDF page could be drawn.\"\n- Cold restore now frames the sheet (cold_restore_before_fix.png / cold_restore_after_fix.png).",
