iled job, cleared queue.\n3. The heavy-flag average now ignores jobs that came back all EMPTY (they took no time and pulled the average down).\n4. Live PDF tiles are now copied to Config.HARDWARE on the raster lane (API 28+, behind a flag), as the design asked. Bake tiles stay software for the encoder.\n5. The failure and recovery dialogs now say \"Not Now\" as the contract specifies. I did this by enabling the existing catalog entry for Android and regenerating, with no new strings.\n6. Removed a stale PdfTiler mention in a comment.\n7. Added an instrumented bake test (cancel mid-bake; baked WebP vs live render).\n\nI did not edit ios/. The only shared file I changed is localization/catalog.json (one platforms entry).\n\nRelease check: an R8-minified release builds, and its dex contains no TACMAP_DEBUG strings or DebugLaunchHooks class, so the debug hooks are compiled out of release.",
